#. paragraph
#: site/how-to.md:56
msgid "On Windows, open the [Windows downloads page](https://www.python.org/downloads/windows/), find the newest **Python 3.13.x** under *Stable Releases* and take **Download Windows installer (64-bit)** - not the \"Python install manager\" and not the newest Python (3.15) at the top. On the first screen of the installer, tick **Add python.exe to PATH**. Check the tools in a terminal (in VS Code: **Terminal > New Terminal**; on Windows, the Command Prompt - see [VS Code and the terminal](#terminal)):"
msgstr "На Windows отворете [страницата за изтегляне за Windows](https://www.python.org/downloads/windows/), намерете най-новия **Python 3.13.x** под *Stable Releases* и изберете **Download Windows installer (64-bit)** - не \"Python install manager\" и не най-новия Python (3.15) най-горе. На първия екран на инсталатора сложете отметка на **Add python.exe to PATH**. Проверете инструментите в терминал (във VS Code: **Terminal > New Terminal**; на Windows - Command Prompt, вижте [VS Code и терминалът](#terminal)):"

#. paragraph
#: site/how-to.md:74
msgid "You see `Python 3.12.x` or `Python 3.13.x`, and `git version 2.x.x`."
msgstr "Виждате `Python 3.12.x` или `Python 3.13.x`, и `git version 2.x.x`."

#. paragraph
#: site/how-to.md:76
msgid "The libraries (pandas, NumPy, ...) are installed into a *virtual environment* in the Homework folder - see [step 9](#create-the-venv) below."
msgstr "Библиотеките (pandas, NumPy, ...) се инсталират във *виртуална среда* (virtual environment) в папката Homework - вижте [стъпка 9](#create-the-venv) по-долу."

